Now add `_isAimingAtVent` and `_isAimingAtMuzan` helpers. Place before `_updateAI` or after. Use current camera position and vent coordinates. Note `this.lookYaw` sign: `lookYaw = clamp(lookYaw - dx*0.0031)`; dragging right (dx>0) decreases yaw, so positive yaw looks left. The vent is to the left (x negative), so positive yaw. Forward vector for YXZ rotation with yaw: x = -sin(yaw)*cos(pitch), z = -cos(yaw)*cos(pitch). At yaw +0.44, x=-0.42, z=-0.90; vent direction x=-0.44, z=-0.89. Dot positive. Good.

