But main.js calls `requestAnimationFrame(loop)` at boot; no loop. It also uses `requestAnimationFrame(() => hud.classList.add('is-visible'))` in onNightStart; no big deal. `void card.offsetWidth` fine.
The loading screen timer uses setTimeout 1350ms to showTitle; okay. We can wait 2s for game object.
